/// G-Buffer push constants — VT debug + heightmap self-shadow + tessellation.
/// 32 bytes: u32 + 4×f32 + u32 + 2×f32. Well within 128-byte minimum guarantee.
/// tess_active at offset 20: TCS/TES tessellation control + fragment PDO scaling.
/// shadow_sun_dir/shadow_strength: heightmap self-shadow tracing in fragment shader.
